"se od kódů na webu liší — při poptávce uveďte kód ze stránky obrazu."
msgstr ""
"The catalogue is a comprehensive overview of the artist's work. The "
"paintings are ordered by category, each with its catalogue code and "
"dimensions. Catalogue codes differ from the codes on this website — in your "
"enquiry, please use the code from the painting page."

