"realismus a květinová zátiší. Vyberte si dílo a pošlete poptávku s kódem."
msgstr ""
"Original paintings by Oldřich Lajsek from his estate: landscapes, "
"abstraction, realism and floral still lifes. Choose a work and send an "
"enquiry with its code."

